  "details": "Currently there is a bug were chair toggles on avatars are not saved or sync with other players, this happens on avatars that have GoGo Loco on them but i'v seen it on a few avatars that don't use GoGo Loco and the bug is the same.\n\nThere's a temp fix I found that might help fix the issue but is annoying to do.\n\n1. Load into the avatar. 2. activate the chair toggle. 3. have the other person hide and re-show your avatar while your toggle is active. \n\nBut if you leave, re-join or change worlds or change avatars then the bug comes back forcing you and the other players to repeat the fix each time.\n\nThis bug started happening recently maybe due to a code error in the latest update, as avatars new and old that had or has chair toggles with or without GoGo Loco did work but after a recent update I've noticed this bug was effected on all new and old avatars that had chair toggles.",
